'''Maneki Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Summer Break Cats Paradise (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Paradise]] and [[Medal King's Palace (Event Gacha)|Medal King's Palace]] Event Gachas. It was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 342
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Maneki Cat
|name2 = Neo Maneki Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Neo Maneki Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Maneki Cat's sole usage is earning extra money when defeating an enemy. The addition of it being included in [[Thanks for All (Combo)|Thanks for All]], a 1-Slot [[Cat Combo]], can increase the money drop of the enemy by 10%, so the [[Money Up]] ability will increase the enemies' money drop to 2.2x rather than just 2x its original. However, due to its short range, weak stats and single target attacks, it won't be viable outside of the early [[Empire of Cats]] stages as there are better units that can replace this unit, such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave}}

